<title>UK: Rheinhypo sets 750 mln French franc 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rheinhypo sets 750 mln French franc 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Commerciale de France and Banque Louis Dreyfus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    750 MLN FRF   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    27.MAR.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.474   PAY DATE    27.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.874    SPREAD	+47.5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 2008 AND 2011 OATS -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
